        "effect": "Renew allies in Area of Effect modular ATK up equal to +3%(+4.8%) of Erato's on-cast (post-buff) ATK stat for 2 rounds. Effect increases by 100% for each allied unit in the squad, up to +15%(+24%) with 5 units. After usage, inflict Erato ATK down -40% (Normal Effect) for the rest of the wave. Effect stacks.",
